### Reference repositories (patterns studied / adapted)

These upstreams are tracked in `scripts/check_absorption_drift.py` (ABSORBED_REPOS)
as pattern references; FlintTrade's implementations are its own. Attribution to
their authors is preserved here (see each repository for its licence terms):

- TradingAgents (https://github.com/TradingAgents-AI/TradingAgents) — multi-agent research patterns
- FinMem (https://github.com/pipiku915/FinMem-LLM-StockTrading) — LLM trading-memory patterns
- AlgoTrading (https://github.com/StockSharp/AlgoTrading) — strategy reference
- fluxscan (https://github.com/marketcalls/fluxscan) — screener patterns
- pandas_signals_library (https://github.com/marketcalls/pandas_signals_library) — indicator-signal patterns
- raptorbt (https://github.com/marketcalls/raptorbt) — backtest-engine patterns
- AlgoMirror — multi-account mirror, trailing-SL and risk-event patterns; reimplemented
  clean-room natively in `packages/services/ditto` (attribution preserved here)

